      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779943296339,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "int length()\n--> Returns total number of characters in string\n\nchar charAt(int index)\n--> Returns character present at given index\n\nboolean equals(String another)\n--> Compares two strings content\n\nboolean equalsIgnoreCase(String another)\n--> Compares strings ignoring uppercase/lowercase\n\nint compareTo(String another)\n--> Lexicographically compares two strings\n\nboolean contains(CharSequence s)\n--> Checks whether substring exists or not\n\nboolean startsWith(String prefix)\n--> Checks whether string starts with given text\n\nboolean endsWith(String suffix)\n--> Checks whether string ends with given text\n\nint indexOf(char ch)\n--> Returns first occurrence index of character\n\nint indexOf(String str)\n--> Returns first occurrence index of substring\n\nint lastIndexOf(char ch)\n--> Returns last occurrence index of character\n\nint lastIndexOf(String str)\n--> Returns last occurrence index of substring\n\nString substring(int beginIndex)\n--> Extracts string from given index to end\n\nString substring(int beginIndex, int endIndex)\n--> Extracts string between beginIndex and endIndex\n\nString toUpperCase()\n--> Converts string into uppercase\n\nString toLowerCase()\n--> Converts string into lowercase\n\nString trim()\n--> Removes starting and ending spaces\n\nString strip()\n--> Removes Unicode whitespaces from both sides\n\nString stripLeading()\n--> Removes leading spaces\n\nString stripTrailing()\n--> Removes trailing spaces\n\nboolean isEmpty()\n--> Checks whether string length is 0\n\nboolean isBlank()\n--> Checks whether string contains only spaces or is empty\n\nString replace(char oldChar, char newChar)\n--> Replaces old character with new character\n\nString replace(CharSequence target, CharSequence replacement)\n--> Replaces substring with another substring\n\nString replaceAll(String regex, String replacement)\n--> Replaces all matching regex patterns\n\nString replaceFirst(String regex, String replacement)\n--> Replaces first matching regex pattern\n\nString[] split(String regex)\n--> Splits string into array based on delimiter/regex\n\nString[] split(String regex, int limit)\n--> Splits string with limit\n\nString concat(String str)\n--> Joins current string with another string\n\nboolean matches(String regex)\n--> Checks whether string matches regex pattern\n\nchar[] toCharArray()\n--> Converts string into character array\n\nbyte[] getBytes()\n--> Converts string into byte array\n\nstatic String valueOf(any datatype)\n--> Converts given datatype into String\n\nstatic String join(CharSequence delimiter, CharSequence... elements)\n--> Joins multiple strings using delimiter\n\nString repeat(int count)\n--> Repeats string multiple times\n\nString intern()\n--> Returns pooled reference from String Pool\n\nStream<String> lines()\n--> Converts multiline string into Stream of lines\n\nstatic String format(String format, Object... args)\n--> Creates formatted string\n\nvoid getChars(int srcBegin, int srcEnd, char[] dest, int destBegin)\n--> Copies characters into character array\n\nint codePointAt(int index)\n--> Returns Unicode value of character\n\nint codePointBefore(int index)\n--> Returns Unicode value before given index\n\nint codePointCount(int beginIndex, int endIndex)\n--> Counts Unicode characters\n\nCharSequence subSequence(int start, int end)\n--> Extracts subsequence from string\n\nboolean contentEquals(CharSequence cs)\n--> Compares content with another sequence\n\nboolean regionMatches(int toffset, String other, int ooffset, int len)\n--> Compares specific regions of strings\n\nstatic String copyValueOf(char[] data)\n--> Converts character array into String\n\nstatic String copyValueOf(char[] data, int offset, int count)\n--> Converts part of character array into String",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "int length()\n--> Returns total number of characters in string\n\nchar charAt(int index)\n--> Returns character present at given index\n\nboolean equals(String another)\n--> Compares two strings content\n\nboolean equalsIgnoreCase(String another)\n--> Compares strings ignoring uppercase/lowercase\n\nint compareTo(String another)\n--> Lexicographically compares two strings\n\nboolean contains(CharSequence s)\n--> Checks whether substring exists or not\n\nboolean startsWith(String prefix)\n--> Checks whether string starts with given text\n\nboolean endsWith(String suffix)\n--> Checks whether string ends with given text\n\nint indexOf(char ch)\n--> Returns first occurrence index of character\n\nint indexOf(String str)\n--> Returns first occurrence index of substring\n\nint lastIndexOf(char ch)\n--> Returns last occurrence index of character\n\nint lastIndexOf(String str)\n--> Returns last occurrence index of substring\n\nString substring(int beginIndex)\n--> Extracts string from given index to end\n\nString substring(int beginIndex, int endIndex)\n--> Extracts string between beginIndex and endIndex\n\nString toUpperCase()\n--> Converts string into uppercase\n\nString toLowerCase()\n--> Converts string into lowercase\n\nString trim()\n--> Removes starting and ending spaces\n\nString strip()\n--> Removes Unicode whitespaces from both sides\n\nString stripLeading()\n--> Removes leading spaces\n\nString stripTrailing()\n--> Removes trailing spaces\n\nboolean isEmpty()\n--> Checks whether string length is 0\n\nboolean isBlank()\n--> Checks whether string contains only spaces or is empty\n\nString replace(char oldChar, char newChar)\n--> Replaces old character with new character\n\nString replace(CharSequence target, CharSequence replacement)\n--> Replaces substring with another substring\n\nString replaceAll(String regex, String replacement)\n--> Replaces all matching regex patterns\n\nString replaceFirst(String regex, String replacement)\n--> Replaces first matching regex pattern\n\nString[] split(String regex)\n--> Splits string into array based on delimiter/regex\n\nString[] split(String regex, int limit)\n--> Splits string with limit\n\nString concat(String str)\n--> Joins current string with another string\n\nboolean matches(String regex)\n--> Checks whether string matches regex pattern\n\nchar[] toCharArray()\n--> Converts string into character array\n\nbyte[] getBytes()\n--> Converts string into byte array\n\nstatic String valueOf(any datatype)\n--> Converts given datatype into String\n\nstatic String join(CharSequence delimiter, CharSequence... elements)\n--> Joins multiple strings using delimiter\n\nString repeat(int count)\n--> Repeats string multiple times\n\nString intern()\n--> Returns pooled reference from String Pool\n\nStream<String> lines()\n--> Converts multiline string into Stream of lines\n\nstatic String format(String format, Object... args)\n--> Creates formatted string\n\nvoid getChars(int srcBegin, int srcEnd, char[] dest, int destBegin)\n--> Copies characters into character array\n\nint codePointAt(int index)\n--> Returns Unicode value of character\n\nint codePointBefore(int index)\n--> Returns Unicode value before given index\n\nint codePointCount(int beginIndex, int endIndex)\n--> Counts Unicode characters\n\nCharSequence subSequence(int start, int end)\n--> Extracts subsequence from string\n\nboolean contentEquals(CharSequence cs)\n--> Compares content with another sequence\n\nboolean regionMatches(int toffset, String other, int ooffset, int len)\n--> Compares specific regions of strings\n\nstatic String copyValueOf(char[] data)\n--> Converts character array into String\n\nstatic String copyValueOf(char[] data, int offset, int count)\n--> Converts part of character array into String",
